    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANOTHER VOICE</strong> is a computer game in the FPS-survival horror genre, combining elements of RPG and action-adventure in a semi-open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/17cb0e7109c157054ffb0e717cbedb81.avif?t=1739606400\" width=600 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY OF THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay focuses on a variable storyline that offers players the opportunity to make decisions that influence the development of the story. Players immerse themselves in a rich world filled with unique characters and explore diverse locations full of mysteries and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e22a291168e6bf49a9c47f3726b8bdbd.poster.avif?t=1739606400\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e22a291168e6bf49a9c47f3726b8bdbd.webm?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e22a291168e6bf49a9c47f3726b8bdbd.mp4?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AND THE WORLD COLLAPSED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During certain events that occurred in the world between 1965 and 1968, humanity faced an unprecedented and extremely dangerous disaster known as the &quot;Rifts.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment a Rift forms, space within a certain radius compresses significantly, and then suddenly returns to its original state, releasing a massive amount of energy in the form of a powerful shockwave that deforms the landscape and destroys much of the infrastructure. The wave spreads evenly within a certain radius, creating a clear boundary outline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e3cdbff603e3b42769e518169235391c.poster.avif?t=1739606400\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e3cdbff603e3b42769e518169235391c.webm?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e3cdbff603e3b42769e518169235391c.mp4?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD OF PHENOMENA AND DISTORTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a result of the distortions and the saturation of the entire area with unknown radiation, numerous new formations emerge. The most striking example is the &quot;Phenomena.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Phenomenon is a local distortion of the fundamental laws of the world, taking on a tangible or visible form to humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the aforementioned, phenomena can also affect organic life. This influence leads to the creation of new beings known as &quot;Distorted.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Distorted are organisms formed under the influence of phenomena from the remnants of living organisms and elements of the environment, or previously existing living organisms that have been transformed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/913c0f6b883d1c7424f850c26d7cb259.poster.avif?t=1739606400\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/913c0f6b883d1c7424f850c26d7cb259.webm?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/913c0f6b883d1c7424f850c26d7cb259.mp4?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANOTHER VOICE</strong> is a computer game in the FPS-survival horror genre, combining elements of RPG and action-adventure in a semi-open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/17cb0e7109c157054ffb0e717cbedb81.avif?t=1739606400\" width=600 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY OF THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay focuses on a variable storyline that offers players the opportunity to make decisions that influence the development of the story. Players immerse themselves in a rich world filled with unique characters and explore diverse locations full of mysteries and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e22a291168e6bf49a9c47f3726b8bdbd.poster.avif?t=1739606400\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e22a291168e6bf49a9c47f3726b8bdbd.webm?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e22a291168e6bf49a9c47f3726b8bdbd.mp4?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AND THE WORLD COLLAPSED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During certain events that occurred in the world between 1965 and 1968, humanity faced an unprecedented and extremely dangerous disaster known as the &quot;Rifts.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment a Rift forms, space within a certain radius compresses significantly, and then suddenly returns to its original state, releasing a massive amount of energy in the form of a powerful shockwave that deforms the landscape and destroys much of the infrastructure. The wave spreads evenly within a certain radius, creating a clear boundary outline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e3cdbff603e3b42769e518169235391c.poster.avif?t=1739606400\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e3cdbff603e3b42769e518169235391c.webm?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/e3cdbff603e3b42769e518169235391c.mp4?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD OF PHENOMENA AND DISTORTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a result of the distortions and the saturation of the entire area with unknown radiation, numerous new formations emerge. The most striking example is the &quot;Phenomena.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Phenomenon is a local distortion of the fundamental laws of the world, taking on a tangible or visible form to humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the aforementioned, phenomena can also affect organic life. This influence leads to the creation of new beings known as &quot;Distorted.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Distorted are organisms formed under the influence of phenomena from the remnants of living organisms and elements of the environment, or previously existing living organisms that have been transformed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/913c0f6b883d1c7424f850c26d7cb259.poster.avif?t=1739606400\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/913c0f6b883d1c7424f850c26d7cb259.webm?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527700/extras/913c0f6b883d1c7424f850c26d7cb259.mp4?t=1739606400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
